Portable engine tests (no board required):

  g++ -std=c++11 -Wall -Wextra -Werror -pedantic \
      -fsanitize=address,undefined -Iinclude test/test_engine.cpp \
      -o /tmp/gateometry-test
  /tmp/gateometry-test

Run from the project root. These standalone tests use standard assert rather
than the PlatformIO device test runner. See ../README.md for hardware checks.
